	dcterms:description "The task requires students to collaboratively produce a technical report following SBC formatting guidelines, clearly documenting system design choices, implementation strategies, simulation results, and compliance with project specifications as part of the final deliverable."@en .

  ontoksd:TASK04_C12 a ontoksd:CompetenceAssociation ;
